      "attestations": [
        {
          "text": "Liu Ch'ing 劉清 (T. 天一, H. 松齋, 1742–1827), a native of Kuang-shun, Kweichow, began his career as a civil official and served as magistrate in Szechwan when the war started in 1796. He commanded a group of volunteers and rose to be provincial judge of Szechwan in 1802.",
          "source": "eccp-3642446",
          "kind": "source-wording",
          "status": "imported"
        },
